step	1	1	After starting the quest
line	<col=000080><col=800000>Thormac</col> the Sorcerer has lost three of his pet <col=800000>Kharid scorpions</col>. He gave me a <col=800000>Scorpion cage</col> to bring them back in. He suggested a <col=800000>Seer</col> in <col=800000>Seers' Village</col> might be able to tell me where they are.</col>
step	2	2	After speaking to the Seer
line	<str>Thormac the Sorcerer has lost three of his pet Kharid scorpions. He gave me a Scorpion cage to bring them back in.</str>
line	<col=000080>The <col=800000>Seer</col> saw one of the scorpions in <col=800000>Taverley Dungeon</col>, near the coffins and spiders, in a room behind an old wall. I should search the walls there and catch it.</col>
step	3	3	After catching the first scorpion
line	<str>Thormac the Sorcerer has lost three of his pet Kharid scorpions. He gave me a Scorpion cage to bring them back in.</str>
line	<str>The Seer saw one of the scorpions in Taverley Dungeon, near the coffins and spiders, in a room behind an old wall.</str>
line	<col=000080>I caught the first scorpion in <col=800000>Taverley Dungeon</col>, and the <col=800000>Seer</col> located the other two: one is at the <col=800000>Barbarian Outpost</col> and the other is on the upper floor of the <col=800000>Edgeville Monastery</col>. I should catch them both and return to <col=800000>Thormac</col>.</col>
